{
  "id": "confluence-live-docs-restore-the-most-recently-seen-emoji",
  "title": "Live Docs: Restore the most recently seen emoji",
  "product": "Confluence",
  "status": "rolling_out",
  "description": "Confluence now restores the most recently seen emoji on a Live Doc instead of defaulting to a generic emoji. This change ensures that when you remove or replace an emoji, the restore action brings back the specific state you last saw, providing a more intuitive and predictable experience. To get started with this change Open a Live Doc that has a title emoji.\n\tRemove the emoji from the title area.\n\tSelect the Restore option to bring back the most recently seen emoji.",
